    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Congratulations",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": " Pegasus Knight\n\u0022The battle rages on until the lifeless body of the Celestial King falls to the ground! The Empire has proven its strength and yet another kingdom falls under its banner. What\u0027s this? The Celestial King\u0027s body vanishes..?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244UN0029",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Forest Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Attacks",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022Destroy the Empire! Attack with vengeance!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Victory Text",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Apprentice \n\u0022The King has received a message from the stars...we have learned that there is great corruption within the ranks of the Empire! Praise Xenos, the Celestial King!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Lord \n\u0022The Celestial King? He is a weak fool! He lives beyond the forest! I\u0027m guessing the elves will not let you live long enough to meet him. Hahahah...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc Guard TWO",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Master Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "New Gamor",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashkael \n\u0022With the defeat of the Lady Spectre of New Gamor; the secrets of the Heretic Mages are returned...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "New Gamor Message One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lady Spectre \n\u0022We...sssurrender.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Xenos Castle Message One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Witch-Hunter \n\u0022The Legions Of The Damned represent everything that we have fought against. This is not over!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lightning Attack",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "New Gamor Curse",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lady Spectre \n\u0022New Gamor will never fall to the outsssiders... Feel the wrath of a forbidden city that you shhhall never enter!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sorenburg",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elf Ranger \n\u0022The Elves are many and fierce! We will drive you out of our territory!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ghostly Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ghost \n\u0022Turn away, young one... and you will live to see the sssun rise once more. Come closer... and you will not live to sssee it ssset tonight.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ghostly Message Legions",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ghost \n\u0022The Lady Ssspectre cannot be defeated! Become a follower of the dark glory of New Gamor; be one of usss!  Leave your former Heretic life. We shall first dessstroy you ass you are now and remake you into sssomething beautiful! Do not be afraid...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peculiar Sojourn Two",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Lord \n\u0022Destroy the demons! Send them back to their filthy prison!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lady Spectre",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lady Spectre \n\u0022Hail the Lady Ssspectre of New Gamor! Feel the might of your own ssspells and fall under my dark powers, Hereticsss!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Warlock",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Warlock \n\u0022We have taken over this tower in the name of chaos. The Empire can never defeat the forces of evil!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Story",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Paladin \n\u0022We must find and destroy Xenos\u0027s kingdom! Xenos, renowned as the Celestial King, is an enemy of the Empire! Xenos told the Elves that the Empire threatens to destroy their forest homes in order to reach him. We must prepare for an attack.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Witch-Hunter \n\u0022The Celestial King will avenge us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus message two",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Witch-Hunter \n\u0022The Legions Of The Damned? We should have known! After the evil vixen took New Gamor, the evil forces should surely seek us!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "New Gamor Warning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lady Spectre \n\u0022New Gamor will protect her bordersss... an outsider who entersss it can expect our curse!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Celestial Lightning",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Celestial Lightning Two",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pegasus Knight \n\u0022The Celestial King knows that we are here! Make Haste!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lady Spectre One",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0023",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Arch-Devil \n\u0022The Lady Spectre knows that we are after her! No matter, we will find her and take back what is ours...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Legion Story",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0024",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashkael \n\u0022A fool who will not live long has done the unthinkable - stolen from the Legions of The Damned! Our Mages are missing their most valuable scrolls. The Mage Order has been weakened by this loss...we must take back what is ours!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Revelation 7",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0025",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage \n\u0022There is a certain energy that the Celestial King generates... I almost feel that his presence prevents us from reaching our full magical potential!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leave Our Island",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0026",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage \n\u0022Leave our island at once! We are loyal to the Celestial King and outsiders are not allowed. I have given your weakened legs the strength to move... Use this gift wisely and leave now!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duke Turn Coat",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0027",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duke \n\u0022Fools! To know the Lady is to know the purest evil... Her touch is rapture; to turn away from her divine touch is madness! The Legions Of The Damned shall fall to the incomparable Lady Spectre.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Turn Coat",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S244SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S244EV0028",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Archmage \n\u0022Why are we attacking this kingdom? The Celestial King is a kind and just man... I believe that the Empire is the aggressor! I cannot and will not help you with this unjust mission!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
